    {
      "predicate": "iadas:authorConclusion",
      "object": "Three dimensions of perfectionism contributed to the prediction of dietary restraint. Excessive commitment is a good predictor of dietary restraint (6%-10%) explained variance. The links between each of the three dimensions of perfectionism (self-oriented, socially prescribed, self-presentation) and dietary restraint were significantly reduced by the inclusion of the exercise commitment variable as a mediator."
    },
    {
      "predicate": "iadas:perspectives",
      "object": "To clarify temporal sequelae, research would need to examine more closely over time the behavioral, psychological, social and perhaps biological precipants and consequences of both dieting and exercise behavior."
